From: Androlinzberg host integration
Subject: [PATCH] HWUI: initialize optional layer crop and buffer transform

Readback::copyImageInto constructs a temporary Layer without a BufferQueue
update. LayerDrawable::DrawLayer nevertheless reads its window transform,
so uninitialized bits can rotate and distort ordinary hardware bitmap copies.
Initialize the optional geometry to no crop and the identity buffer transform.
DeferredLayerUpdater continues to replace these defaults with queued metadata.

--- a/libs/hwui/Layer.h
+++ b/libs/hwui/Layer.h
@@ -141,12 +141,12 @@
     /**
      * Optional crop
      */
-    SkRect mCurrentCropRect;
+    SkRect mCurrentCropRect = SkRect::MakeEmpty();
 
     /**
      * Optional transform
      */
-    uint32_t mWindowTransform;
+    uint32_t mWindowTransform = 0;
 
     /**
      * An image backing the layer.
